ale":"O Beaufortovi lestvici","The dew point is what the temperature would need to fall to for dew to form. It can be a useful way to tell how humid the air feels — the higher the dew point, the more humid it feels. A dew point that matches the current temperature means the relative humidity is 100%, and there may be dew or fog.":"Temperatura je točka, na katero mora priti, da se formira vrha. Lahko je uporaben način za ugotovitev, kako vlažno je zrak.","About Dew Point":"O Dew Point","Relative humidity, commonly known just as humidity, is the amount of moisture in the air compared with what the air can hold. The air can hold more moisture at higher temperatures. A relative humidity near 100% means there may be dew or fog.":"Relativna vlažnost, običajno znana samo kot vlažnost, je količina vlage v zraku v primerjavi s tem, kar lahko zadrži zrak.% mČe je mogoče, je mogoče, da je orno ali megla.","About Relative Humidity":"O relativni vlage","Intensity is calculated based on how much rain or snow falls per hour and is meant to indicate how heavy the rain or snow will feel. It is also used with other precipitation types such as sleet and wintry mix. A downpour or heavy snowstorm can have a \"heavy\" intensity, while an average rainfall or lighter drizzle can have a \"moderate\" or \"light\" intensity.":"Intenzivnost se izračuna glede na količino dežja ali snega, ki pade v eni uri, in pokaže, kako močne bodo padavine. Uporablja se tudi za druge vrste padavin, kot sta žled in zimska mešanica. Naliv ali močan snežni vihar imata lahko »močno« intenzivnost, medtem ko imata običajen dež ali rahlo pršenje »zmerno« ali »šibko« intenzivnost.","About Precipitation Intensity":"O intenzivnosti dežja","Significant, rapid changes in pressure are used to predict changes in the weather. For example, a drop in pressure can mean that rain or snow is on the way, and rising pressure can mean that weather will improve. Pressure is also called barometric pressure or atmospheric pressure.":"Za napovedovanje sprememb vremenskega stanja se uporabljajo pomembne, hitre spremembe tlaka. Na primer, padec tlaka lahko pomeni, da prihaja dež ali sneg, povečanje tlaka pa lahko pomeni, da se bo vreme izboljšalo.","About Pressure":"O pritiskom","Visibility tells you how far away you can clearly see objects like buildings and hills. It is a measure of the transparency of the air and does not take into account the amount of sunlight or the presence of obstructions. Visibility at or above %@ is considered clear.":"Vidljivost vam pove, kako daleč lahko jasno vidite objekte, kot so stavbe in hribe. %@ je jasno.","About Visibility":"O vidljivosti","Actual":"Dejanski","2 – 5":"2  5","89 – 102":"89  102","103 – 117":"103  117","6 – 11":"6  11","12 – 19":"12  19","20 – 28":"20  28","29 – 38":"29  38","39 – 49":"39  49","50 – 61":"50  61","62 – 74":"62  74","75 – 88":"75  88","Calm":"-Umirite se.","Light air":"Svetlo zrak","Storm":"Sturma","Violent storm":"Nasilna nevihta","Hurricane-force":"Sila uragana","Light breeze":"Mrazen veter","Gentle breeze":"Nežen veter.","Moderate breeze":"Zmerno vetro","Fresh breeze":"Svež veter","Strong breeze":"Močan veter","High wind":"Močan veter.","Gale":"Viharni veter","Strong gale":"Močan veter","Description":"Opis","bft":"Bft","Beaufort Scale":"Beaufortska lestvica","Chance of Precipitation":"Možnost dežja","Clear":"Jasno","Foggy":"Mlačna","Hazy":"Nejasna","Conditions":"Pod pogoji","%d° now with %@ conditions. There is a precipitation chance of %@. Wind from %@ with gusts up to %d %@. Today's temperature ranges from %d° to %d° and feels like %d°. %@, and %@.":"%dZdaj pa z %@ Obstaja možnost, da bo deževalo %@-Veter iz %@ z razstrelami do %d %@Temperatura danes je v razponu od %d° do %d# in se počuti kot %d-Prav. %@in %@-Ne. -Prav.","Daily Summary":"Povzetek dnevnega dneva","The daily chance of precipitation tends to be higher than the chance for each hour.":"Vsak dan je možnost padavin večja od možnosti za vsako uro.","The dew point is %d° to %d°.":"Točka roja je %d° do %d-Prav.","The dew point will be %d° to %d°.":"Točka roja bo %d° do %d-Prav.","Feels Like conveys how warm or cold it feels and can be different from the actual temperature. The Feels Like temperature is affected by humidity, sunlight and wind.":"V tem primeru je v tem trenutku zelo vroče in hladno, a temperatura je odvisna od vlage, sončne svetlobe in vetra.","On %@, the average humidity will be %d%%.\n%@":"Na %@, povprečna vlažnost bo %d%%-Ne. -Prav.\n%@","Today, the average humidity is %d%%. %@":"Danes je povprečna vlažnost %d%%-Ne. -Prav. %@","On %@, the total precipitation will be %.1f%@.":"Na %@, celotna padavine bo %.1f%@-Ne. -Prav.","On %@, the lowest visibility will be %@ at %d %@, and the highest will be %@ at %d %@.":"Na %@, najnižja vidljivost bo %@ v %d %@, in najvišji bo %@ v %d %@-Ne. -Prav.","Today, the visibility will be %@, at %d to %d %@.":"Danes bo vidnost %@, na %d v %d %@-Ne. -Prav.","H: %d°":"Maks.: %d°","Humidity around %d%%":"Vlažnost okoli %d%%","Humidity Avg %d%%":"Vlažnost Avg %d%%","Humidity %d%%":"Vlažnost %d%%","Today's min %d%% – max %d%%":"Danes je min %d%%  največ %d%%","LAST 24 HOURS":"Zadnja 24 ur","L: %d°":"Min.: %d°","NEXT 24 HOURS":"Naslednje 24 ur","No hourly data available for this day.":"Za ta dan ni podatkov na uro.","%@'s low is %d° and the high is %d°. The temperature will feel like %d° to %d°. Wind from %@ is expected. %@":"%@Nizko je %dIn to je visoko %dTemperatura bo kot %d° do %d°. veter iz %@ Pričakovano. %@","Hourly bars for rain & snow (%@).":"Urne štapke za dež in sneg (%@)","Heavy":"Težko","Precipitation: 0%@":"Dežja: 0%@","Rain: %.1f%@":"Dež: %.1f%@","Rain: %.1f%@, Snow: %.1f%@":"Dež: %.1f%@Sneg: %.1f%@","Precipitation Totals":"Skupna količina padcev","On %@, the average pressure will be %@ %@, and the lowest pressure will be %@ %@.":"Na %@, povprečni tlak bo %@ %@, in najnižji tlak bo %@ %@-Ne. -Prav.","Pressure Average %@ %@":"Povprečni tlak %@ %@","Pressure %@ %@":"Tlak %@ %@","Daily range: %@–%@ %@":"Dnevni razpon: %@ Vsaka država%@ %@","Rain":"Dež","Snow":"Sneg","The Beaufort wind scale expresses how forceful or strong the wind is at a given speed. The Beaufort scale may make it easier to understand how windy it will feel or how much effect the wind could have. Each value on the scale corresponds to a wind speed range.":"Beaufortova lestvica vetra izraža, kako močna ali močna je vetra pri določeni hitrosti.","The actual air temperature.":"Temperatura zraka.","The wind speed is calculated using the average over a short period of time. Gusts are short bursts of wind above this average. A gust typically lasts under 20 seconds.":"Hitrost vetra se izračuna z uporabo povprečja v kratkem času.","Today's chance: %d%%":"Današnja priložnost: %d%%","Total":"Skupna","No moderate or higher UV levels are expected for this day.":"Za ta dan ni pričakovanih zmernih ali višjih UV- koncentracij.","Sun protection recommended. UV levels range from %@ to %@, reached between %@ and %@.":"Priporočljivo je zaščito pred soncem. %@ v %@, dosežena med %@ in %@-Ne. -Prav.","Today's %@ %d":"Danes. %@ %d","UV index up to %d":"UV indeks do %d","Visibility %d %@":"Vidljivost %d %@","min %d – max %d %@":"min. %d  največ %d %@","What the temperature feels like as a result of humidity, sunlight or wind.":"Kako se temperatura počuti zaradi vlage, sončne svetlobe ali vetra.","Gusts up to %d":"V redu je. %d","Wind Speed %d":"Hitrost vetra %d","Wind Speed %d-%d":"Hitrost vetra %d-Prav.%d","Wind is currently %1$d %2$@ from the %3$@. Today, wind speeds are %4$d to %5$d %2$@, with gusts up to %6$d %2$@.":"V veter je trenutno %1$d %2$@ iz %3$@Danes je hitrost vetra %4$d v %5$d %2$@, z raznimi %6$d %2$@-Ne. -Prav.","Wind speeds range from %1$d to %2$d %3$@, with gusts up to %4$d %3$@.":"Hitrosti vetra se raztezajo od %1$d v %2$d %3$@, z raznimi %4$d %3$@-Ne. -Prav.","Weather views":"Pogled na vreme","Max S":"Najv. hitrost","Max G":"Najv. sunek","Illumination":"Svetloba","10-DAY 